      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The `appClipDefaultExperiences` resource provides functionality to read information about the default App Clip experience you configure for your App Clip. Additionally, it provides functionality to create a default App Clip experience, to update an existing default App Clip experience, and to delete an unreleased default App Clip experience.",
          "refs": []
        }
